# AutoDL Forecast Cache Commands

Run these commands from the `cprl/` directory so `forecast_cache_seed*/` is written
under `cprl/`, where `scripts/run_cache_experiments.py` can discover it.

This uses `scripts/run_tsl_forecast_cache.py`, which matches the existing cache
protocol: train a time_series_library forecaster, export pred_len-step forecasts
on val/test, and average overlapping horizon forecasts by absolute time index.

python3 scripts/run_tsl_forecast_cache.py --model_id bci_amazon_vol_cache --model Autoformer --data custom --root_path time_series_library/dataset/new_benchmarks/bci_vol/ --data_path bci_amazon_vol.csv --features MS --target OT --freq d --seq_len 96 --label_len 48 --pred_len 96 --enc_in 3 --dec_in 3 --c_out 1 --des bci_amazon_vol_Autoformer_seed2021 --seed 2021 --train_epochs 20 --batch_size 32 --use_gpu --gpu_type cuda
python3 scripts/run_tsl_forecast_cache.py --model_id bci_amazon_vol_cache --model Crossformer --data custom --root_path time_series_library/dataset/new_benchmarks/bci_vol/ --data_path bci_amazon_vol.csv --features MS --target OT --freq d --seq_len 96 --label_len 48 --pred_len 96 --enc_in 3 --dec_in 3 --c_out 1 --des bci_amazon_vol_Crossformer_seed2021 --seed 2021 --train_epochs 20 --batch_size 32 --use_gpu --gpu_type cuda
